---
description: Fastify SIWE/SIWS plus custom wagmi wallet UI in apps/web
globs: "apps/web/**/*.{ts,tsx}"
alwaysApply: false
---

## Scope

`apps/web` may add Wagmi, Wallet Standard, and `@/wallet/` for a **custom** connect modal. Do not add RainbowKit, Dynamic, or AppKit UI. Import connectors from `wagmi/connectors/injected` and `wagmi/connectors/walletConnect`, not the `wagmi/connectors` barrel.

Login and Settings call existing Fastify SIWE/SIWS via `@repo/react` (`useVerifyWeb3Auth`, `useVerifyLinkWallet`). Fastify remains the JWT issuer. Unlinked wallets must not create users.

